{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up to conquer the impossible in Pyramidion, a physics-based cooperative action-puzzler for 2 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: work together to move a massive, unwieldy stone block to the summit of a monolithic pyramid. The execution, however, is a true test of skill, strategy, and communication. Choose from distinct roles, each with unique abilities crucial for success. Will you be the steadfast <strong>Worker</strong>, providing the core strength, or the strategic <strong>Foreman</strong>, using your whip to empower your teammate and clear obstacles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a treacherous, physics-driven path where every push, every turn, and every stumble matters. A single misstep can send your precious cargo tumbling down, fracturing it and resetting your progress to the last checkpoint. Only through perfect coordination and strategic use of your abilities will you overcome the pyramid's challenges and etch your legend in stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game\u2014it's a trial of teamwork. Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024600?t=1760317026","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024600?t=1760317026","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/5605c4174728662f688500e6445e2e945f6a79b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760317026","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/5605c4174728662f688500e6445e2e945f6a79b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760317026","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up to conquer the impossible in Pyramidion, a physics-based cooperative action-puzzler for 2 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: work together to move a massive, unwieldy stone block to the summit of a monolithic pyramid. The execution, however, is a true test of skill, strategy, and communication. Choose from distinct roles, each with unique abilities crucial for success. Will you be the steadfast <strong>Worker</strong>, providing the core strength, or the strategic <strong>Foreman</strong>, using your whip to empower your teammate and clear obstacles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a treacherous, physics-driven path where every push, every turn, and every stumble matters. A single misstep can send your precious cargo tumbling down, fracturing it and resetting your progress to the last checkpoint. Only through perfect coordination and strategic use of your abilities will you overcome the pyramid's challenges and etch your legend in stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game\u2014it's a trial of teamwork. Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TechDevAYDIN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/bb791e127c67cd6ddbf4d730787f9f955917ed04/header.jpg?t=1760317026","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum: